# [Dawnline](dawnline)

Mereth turns so slowly that its night lasts sixty days, and its day is hot enough to melt
lead. The farming colony of Stillwater sits in a canyon on the night side. The Dawnline -
the edge of the light - is coming up the valley, and the colony's hauler is grounded.

Everything below is content. `story.mast` spawns it and counts it; the words live here and
in `scenes.amd`. The three ways out are the Patience (fly them), the Lantern (shade them)
and the Gnaw (make a deal), and the six side stories each open or cheapen one of them.

## [Voices](voices)

Speakers the scenes name. Nobody here is spawned from this list; the people you can walk
up to are in `## People`.

### [Stillwater](stillwater)
---
Roles: narrator
Color: "#cba"
---
The colony, and what you are looking at.

### [The Lantern](lantern_voice)
---
Roles: narrator
Color: "#8df"
---
Something very old, speaking in shapes.

## [Hails](hails)

What reaches the bridge. These choices are the ship's, so they carry no crew guards.

### [Stillwater Is Calling](orbit_call)
---
Speaker: stillwater
Title: Stillwater Colony
Presentation: orbit
Subject: gasgiant
Color: "#cba"
---
% Automated relay, looping. Two hundred and twelve colonists, one grounded hauler, and a line of sunrise forty minutes out. Then a live voice cuts in: "Whoever you are - we need hands on the ground, not a lecture from orbit."

- [Tell them a landing party is coming](orbit_accept)
- [Ask what the hauler needs](orbit_detail)
- [Hold position and keep scanning]()

### [What the Hauler Needs](orbit_detail)
---
Speaker: stillwater
Title: Stillwater Colony
Presentation: orbit
Subject: gasgiant
Color: "#cba"
---
% "An injector, a coil, a length of main cable. Parts we HAD, three days ago." A pause. "Come down and I will explain the rest to your face."

- [Tell them a landing party is coming](orbit_accept)
- [Hold position and keep scanning]()

### [A Landing Party Is Coming](orbit_accept)
---
Speaker: stillwater
Title: Stillwater Colony
Presentation: orbit
Subject: gasgiant
Color: "#cba"
---
% "Land on the ridge above us. The canyon floor is no place for a transporter lock." The relay drops back to its loop.

- [Assemble a boarding party]()

### [The Lantern Is Waiting](lantern_power)
---
Speaker: lantern_voice
Title: Landing Party
Presentation: orbit
Subject: gasgiant
Color: "#8df"
---
% From the surface: "The core is seated. It wants power it has not had in a very long time - a lot of it, all at once, from above. Hold orbit and give it everything the conduit can carry."

- [Channel the conduit into the Lantern](lantern_power_go)
- [Not yet]()

### [Conduit Open](lantern_power_go)
---
Speaker: lantern_voice
Title: Landing Party
Presentation: orbit
Subject: gasgiant
Color: "#8df"
---
% The conduit hums. On the ridge above Stillwater, something unfolds toward the sun.

- [Tell the landing party it is theirs]() ; signal lp_power

## [Props](props)

Things on the ground. `At:` is a mark in the area file or `x, y`. `Opens with:` is tried
in order by whoever uses it - a key anyone in the party carries, a skill check, a CUT shot,
or a signal from the bridge.

### [Survey drone](drone)
---
Area: ridge
Mark: drone
Sprite: lp:drone
Blocks: yes
Scene: drone
---
A colony survey drone, nose-down in the scree, its antenna snapped.

