## [Quests](quests)

### [Through the Dawnline](dawnline_arc)
---
State: active
Scope: shared
Done when: signal lp_saved
---
Two hundred and twelve people, one canyon, forty minutes of night. Get them through.

#### [Find the magistrate](meet)
---
State: active
Done when: signal lp_met_magistrate
---
Stillwater's magistrate is in the town hall, down the canyon from the landing ridge.

#### [Fly them out](way_patience)
---
State: secret
Done when: signal lp_launch
---
Fit the three missing parts to the Patience and fly her out of the canyon.

#### [Shade the valley](way_lantern)
---
State: secret
Done when: signal lp_wake
---
Wake the Lantern: put its core back, give it power from orbit, and ask it to turn.

#### [Make a deal](way_gnaw)
---
State: secret
Done when: signal lp_bargain
---
Vhesk's ship could lift the whole colony. She will want something for it.

## [Side Stories](side_stories)

One per job. Each goes to the crew member it is for; one nobody on the ground can take
goes to the whole party.

### [Patience's Heart](patience_heart)
---
For: engineering
State: active
Done when: signal lp_hauler_fixed
---
The injector, the coil and the main cable - find them, and fit them to the Patience.

### [What the Lantern Says](lantern_says)
---
For: science
State: active
Done when: signal lp_glyphs_all
---
Four carved panels: on the salt flats, in the caves, and two inside the Lantern. Read them all before anyone wakes it.

### [The Quiet Deputy](quiet_deputy)
---
For: security
State: active
Done when: signal lp_harrow_confessed
---
Somebody sold the Patience's parts. Find the proof, then find out why.

### [Vhesk's Terms](vhesk_terms)
---
For: comms
State: active
Done when: signal lp_yilla_home
---
The Skaraan boss is holding something back. Find out what she has lost.

### [A Road Through Salt](salt_road)
---
For: helm
State: active
Done when: signal lp_road_done
---
Reset the three survey markers on the flats, so the Patience has a road to fly.

### [The Survey Team](survey_team)
---
For: medical
State: active
Done when: signal lp_survivors_saved
---
Stillwater's survey team went into the Cinder Caves three days ago. Bring them home.
